The **Beat Cop** is the neighborhood's friendly face: young, new to
the force, and always glad to give directions or lend a hand. On quiet
shifts he jots down notes for the crime novel he's writing, as long as
his boss doesn't catch him at it. *Attack +2 (Pistol), Combat Expert
+1, Knowledge +2 (The City In and Out), Knowledge +1 (Writing),
Perceptive +1, Position of Power +2 (Police Officer); Secret -1
(Writing Aspirations), Servitude -2 (Police Department and the Common
Good), Soft Spot -1 (Dessert).*

